   # Assemble the static process topology (K_SESSION_DEFINE /
   # K_PROCESS_GROUP_DEFINE / K_PROCESS_DEFINE_EXT membership lists) directly
-  # into the ELF. Mandatory for static topology, like gen_kobject_list for
